  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PROTEGE Mozambique HIP 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SUMMARY
Plan International, Helpcode and PROMURA will contribute to meeting the basic needs of conflict-affected populations in under-served and under-reached districts, with a special focus on children, adolescents and women, by providing gender-responsive, child-centered, integrated multi-sectoral humanitarian assistance, ensuring access to protection including child protection and SGBV and promoting coordinated humanitarian aid in an enhanced protective environment.</narrative>
  </description>
